---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import MobileMenu from '../components/MobileMenu.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const path = Astro.url.pathname;
---
<Layout
  title="About Us · Lara San Cristóbal"
  description="LARA is a boutique real estate agency in San Cristóbal de las Casas, Chiapas — helping buyers, renters and investors find the right property, land or off-grid build project."
  esHref="/about-es"
>
  <Header esHref="/about-es" />
  <MobileMenu currentPath={path} />

  <section id="top" style="position: relative; min-height: 82vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(110px, 16vh, 180px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(40px, 6vh, 72px);">
    <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/c_fill,ar_16:9,g_auto,w_2000/f_auto,q_auto/v1788330836/INSTAGRAM_CONTENT_202560_eq5ckj.jpg" alt="Lara San Cristóbal" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 45%;" />
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.52) 0%, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.48) 40%, rgba(34, 31, 28, 0.72) 100%);"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1400px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 36px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;">
        <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.72);">About us</span>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; max-width: 17ch; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(37px, 5.63vw, 92px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: 0.005em; color: #FBF8F3; text-wrap: pretty;">Hi, my name is Lara, and I have learned a thing or two</h1>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.7vw, 25px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: 0.005em; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.9);">A dream home in the mountains…</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; max-width: 36ch; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(251, 248, 243, 0.86);">Almost five years in San Cristóbal de las Casas, twenty-five in international real estate, one off-grid house built by hand in the mountains just outside the city.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(70px, 12vh, 150px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(50px, 8vh, 100px);">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 86px); align-items: start;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1788439916/lara_profile_low_mst8mp.jpg" alt="Lara" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
        <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6E655C;">Los Alcanfores, San Cristóbal</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; padding-top: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.02vw, 29px); line-height: 1.36; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-wrap: pretty;">I am lucky enough to have lived in San Cristóbal de las Casas for almost 5 years. I came here just for a visit back in 2021, and fell in love with the place, the people, the beautiful nature and the energy.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">Since deciding to stay, I have purchased residential property and even built an off-grid home in the heart of the stunning mountains a little way outside of the city.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">I live here in Chiapas very happily with my daughter, our two dogs and a horse, and after a fantastic 25 year career at the sharp end of international real estate, working with luxury developers from Thailand, Bali and the Philippines all the way to Ibiza and the Caribbean, and having consulted for groups such as Six Senses, Raffles and Aman, I have learned a thing or two.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(60px, 10vh, 120px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px); background: #E9E1D6;">
    <div style="max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 30px; text-align: center;">
      <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6E655C;">Why work with me</span>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(25px, 3.52vw, 51px); line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: pretty;">If you are looking for someone who really speaks your language, not just in the literal sense, and who understands your concerns, whilst sharing your dreams and aspirations, then please do call.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="background: #221F1C; color: #F2EDE6;">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr)); align-items: stretch;">
      <div style="min-height: 58vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/w_1600/f_auto,q_auto/v1788330928/INSTAGRAM_CONTENT_202554_ukenrr.jpg" alt="The Lara San Cristóbal team" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 26px; padding: clamp(50px, 8vw, 108px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 92px);">
        <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.55);">The team</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.70vw, 55px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: pretty;">Every box ticked, before anything is signed</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 44ch; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.72);">I have built an incredible team of real estate professionals, and together we can ensure that exhaustive due diligence is carried out on each and every opportunity, prior to acquisition, so that whatever you choose to do, you can do it confidently and in the knowledge that all the boxes have been ticked.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.14); margin-top: 6px;">
          <span style="background: #221F1C; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.86);">Architects</span>
          <span style="background: #221F1C; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.86);">Valuers</span>
          <span style="background: #221F1C; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.86);">Lawyers</span>
          <span style="background: #221F1C; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.86);">Notaries</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(60px, 10vh, 120px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px); font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6E655C;">Twenty-five years, briefly</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: rgba(43, 38, 34, 0.14);">
        <div style="background: #F2EDE6; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 168px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 35px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1;">25</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; color: #6E655C;">Years at the sharp end of international real estate.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #F2EDE6; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 168px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 35px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1;">6</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; color: #6E655C;">Markets worked, from Thailand, Bali and the Philippines to Ibiza and the Caribbean.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #F2EDE6; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 168px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25;">Six Senses, Raffles, Aman</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; color: #6E655C;">Groups consulted for, alongside luxury developers and celebrated designers.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #F2EDE6; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 168px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 35px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1;">1</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; color: #6E655C;">Off-grid home built personally, in the mountains outside the city.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-reveal="1" style="padding: clamp(50px, 8vh, 110px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px); background: #FBF8F3;">
    <div style="max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: center;">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(14px, 2vw, 24px);">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/w_1200/f_auto,q_auto/v1788115977/LSC_17_bepwvl.jpg" alt="A San Cristóbal property" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8;" />
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/disybpuro/image/upload/w_1200/f_auto,q_auto/v1788115973/LSC_13_w9j39z.jpg" alt="A San Cristóbal property" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; background: #E4D8C8; margin-top: clamp(22px, 4vw, 56px);" />
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
        <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6E655C;">How I can help</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 200; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.34vw, 51px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: pretty;">A hand to hold, from the first visit to the keys</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 42ch; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.9; color: #6E655C;">Whether you are looking to rent, purchase or even build a traditional or off-grid home, I have been through the entire process personally, and will be delighted to help, offering sensible advice and guidance throughout your journey here.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: rgba(43, 38, 34, 0.14); margin-top: 6px;">
          <a href="/property-for-sale" style="background: #FBF8F3; padding: 18px 2px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
            <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400;">Rent or purchase a home</span>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c15857;">View</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/land-for-sale" style="background: #FBF8F3; padding: 18px 2px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
            <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400;">Buy land to build on</span>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c15857;">View</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/off-grid-builds" style="background: #FBF8F3; padding: 18px 2px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
            <span style="font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400;">Build off-grid, start to finish</span>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c15857;">View</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactCta heading="If you are thinking of investing in San Cristóbal, please do call." />
  <Footer />
</Layout>
